# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Western Plaguelands

step Janice Felstone
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip From the Bulwark, follow the road east into the Western Plaguelands. Felstone Farm is the first farm along the road; Janice waits in the house.
  accept 5021 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Upstairs
  turnin 5021 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Janice's Parcel, beside the house; inside
  accept 5023 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  note Keep the parcel: Royal Overseer Bauhaus is in the Undercity.

step Scarlet forward camp
  tip The Scarlet Crusade's tents stand between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears. Torch the command tent with the Box of Incendiaries and plant the Scourge banner.
  goto 40.7,52.0
  interact 176088
  interact 176088 quest 5096.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  collect 12814 quest 5096.2 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

